    "title": "Freeman Recovery Project Hosting 3rd Annual Recovery Scramble - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andrea Hinds ,\n3 hours ago photo from Unsplash Freeman Recovery Project is hosting its 3rd Annual Recovery Scramble charity golf event. All proceeds benefit the nonprofit organization that provides essentials like safe housing, meals, and basic resources needed for those in early recovery. Click for More Events\nThe event will be held June 30 at GreyStone Golf Club. Registration begins at 7:00 a.m., and play begins at 8:00 a.m.\nIndividuals in recovery will be in attendance, sharing their inspiring stories and the vital role Freeman Recovery Project played in\nhelping them reclaim their lives.\nEVENT DETAILS:\n3rd Annual Recovery Scramble\nGreyStone Golf Club, 2555 U.S. 70, Dickson, TN 37055\nTuesday, June 30 at 7:00 a.m.\nAbout Freeman Recovery Project:\nFreeman Recovery Project (FRP) is a beacon of hope for those facing substance use and mental health challenges in the Dickson, Tennessee area. FRP is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization that connects individuals with the resources, treatment, and support they need on\ntheir path to lasting wellness. For more information, please visit https://freemansolutions.com/partners/freeman-recovery-project/ .",
    "summary": "3 hours ago photo from Unsplash Freeman Recovery Project is hosting its 3rd Annual Recovery Scramble charity golf event. All proceeds benefit the nonprofit organization that provides essentials like safe housing, meals, and basic resources needed for those in early recovery. Individuals in recovery will be in attendance, sharing their inspiring stories and the vital role Freeman Recovery Project played in helping them reclaim their lives.",
